@model IEnumerable<Product>
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Products"; }
<div class="heading"><div><h1>Products</h1><p>Browse and manage your products.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/products/create">+ New product</a></div>
<form method="get" action="/products" class="filters">
 <label>Search<input name="search" value="@ViewBag.Search" placeholder="Name or description" /></label>
 <label>Category<input name="category" value="@ViewBag.Category" placeholder="e.g. Electronics" /></label>
 <label>Min price<input name="minPrice" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="@ViewBag.MinPrice" /></label>
 <label>Max price<input name="maxPrice" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="@ViewBag.MaxPrice" /></label>
 <button type="submit">Filter</button><a class="btn secondary" href="/products">Clear</a>
</form>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Category</th><th>Price</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>
@foreach (var item in Model) { <tr><td>@item.Id</td><td>@item.Name</td><td>@item.Category</td><td>@item.Price.ToString("0.00")</td><td class="actions"><a href="/products/@item.Id">View</a><a href="/products/edit/@item.Id">Edit</a><a class="danger" href="/products/delete/@item.Id">Delete</a></td></tr> }
</tbody></table>
@if (!Model.Any()) { <p>No products match your filters.</p> }
<p class="hint">Alternative list routes: <a href="/items">/items</a>, <a href="/items/index">/items/index</a>, <a href="/products/index">/products/index</a>.</p>
